``` {.python .cell-code}
def mod3_tab(nums):
    neg = -(10**18)
    best = [0, neg, neg]
    for x in nums:
        nxt = best[:]
        for r in range(3):
            if best[r] == neg:
                continue
            s = (r + x) % 3
            nxt[s] = max(nxt[s], best[r] + x)
        best = nxt
    return best[0]
```
